{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1035_p", "source_sha256": "cd0785a50c098b16cd2686424ce1f929e8921d77fd21fff1e735836fc92db89e", "ja": "（ふう）", "zh": "（呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1036_hinatasukinosyutuennsyatati", "source_sha256": "da3c6ddfae664713cb19c5901f308e37e8c0fa061dd724b9368ec64b50781126", "ja": "私たち、ご当地アイドルなんだけど、\nひなたさんにずっと憧れてて！　ずっと目標で……。", "zh": "我们是地方偶像，\n一直都很仰慕阳向小姐！一直把她当作目标……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1037_hinatasukinosyutuennsyatati", "source_sha256": "69623f8b5b435d5e168e02f9df9cf47573f0324b71b10815c73292e189772384", "ja": "前半戦のパフォーマンスも、なまらすごくて！\n圧倒されちゃいました！", "zh": "上半场的表现也超级厉害！\n让我都被震撼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "650f90c05ce766c8deab6b4cf8fbe69ec3072ff0c96a1122364211be32b8bbc1", "ja": "ありゃあ～、ありがとうねぇ。\nそんなに褒めてもらえると、くすぐったいけども……。", "zh": "哎呀～，谢谢你呀。\n被这么夸奖，怪不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1039_hinatasukinosyutuennsyatati", "source_sha256": "59fa26879274be2a0b6bb0b0e83ca512dceda8bf900db26ef1fadaa4a8fae687", "ja": "でも、私たちも地元背負ってるから、\nこのままあきらめるわけにはいかないべさ！", "zh": "但是，我们也背负着家乡的期望，不能就这样放弃啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1040_hinatasukinosyutuennsyatati", "source_sha256": "c230ca81bf4af36f04160233dd350c1b98916a0bd5a3c5762642e72923aa660e", "ja": "後半戦は、ひなたさんに胸を借りるつもりで\nぶつかってくから。したっけね～！　ありがと～！", "zh": "后半战我会抱着向日向请教的心态\n全力拼一把的。那就这样啦～！谢谢啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1041_035hin", "source_sha256": "ca361b996c3ef91a2bf1d56a02e47a066ed9ba502f5725be87a541bfe29b1140", "ja": "あ……う、うん！　こちらこそ、よろしくねぇ～！\n…………。", "zh": "啊……嗯、嗯！我才要请你多多关照呢～！\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1042_shinsain", "source_sha256": "1aa1f12ee3ed37e5e5e6e478a1a9c841d98f680122b7c59d43fdbcb82964e6b3", "ja": "それでは後半戦、開始します。\n表現力のパフォーマンス、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "那么现在开始后半程。\n请展现出出色的表现力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1043_hinatasukinosyutuennsyatati", "source_sha256": "cfe275210bf2095354fafad1c40cc2d85c35b44319e187ce49b4b1de58da55fa", "ja": "「「「よろしくお願いします！！！！」」」", "zh": "「「「请多关照！！！！」」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "778bb5c860266b5b0d0ed83685d11c8c3c1c3eb1ba4f6c2dd288102f3b2973fc", "ja": "みんな、すごい気合いだべさ……！", "zh": "大家的气势都好足啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b89411b8dfa62f217a88271196a3da8395431e646285143196129d784bc0c6f4", "ja": "そうだな。目標で憧れのひなたに挑めるのが、\nきっと嬉しくて仕方がないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊。能向作为目标、憧憬对象的日向发起挑战，他们一定开心得不得了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1046_035hin", "source_sha256": "5aa37791b580592a0775f34a6456753d08a2f84479620e1e21c9d23c84845099", "ja": "あたしに……。でも……。", "zh": "向我……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1047_hokanoaidorunoouenndan", "source_sha256": "a5b5fe3c4d3d85751f0af8f43e57e9adb8073664b89de8d3ae6e6be70e12df31", "ja": "ユキちゃーん！　負けるんでねぇぞーっ！\nみんなが、ついてるぞーっ！", "zh": "雪步——！可不能输啊——！\n大家都支持你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1049_p", "source_sha256": "619aa82462416875148f26273438401d05d9ec9792ccef70fb051b62ed4634ac", "ja": "（……ひなた？）", "zh": "（……是日向？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1051_p", "source_sha256": "68023fbe3647b38689d77fd02919bc6b16f4a9eb6cfde23dde7b7add96ee0a84", "ja": "（後半戦も、残るはステージのみ。だが、ここにきて\nひなたは、トップの座を明け渡してしまった）", "zh": "（后半场也只剩下舞台了。可是到了这个时候，日向却让出了第一名的位置）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1053_027say", "source_sha256": "f38d21caf06f893526c0f0eeab37ad9ec3d5c7f15fac54ff4ac40a49caf97fec", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、えっと……\n大丈夫だよ！　まだ巻き返せるから！", "zh": "日向，那个……\n没事的！还来得及扳回局面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1054_034ayu", "source_sha256": "02f8b055df2648024981cdde95058bd3eb4d8a0ec2c06dd720501250b0b225d7", "ja": "そうそう、点差は全然ないしね！\nステージに向けて、気持ち切り替えてこう！", "zh": "对对，分差根本不大！\n为了接下来的舞台，打起精神来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1055_035hin", "source_sha256": "71157f14fd5536c65bb51551ea930dbe82fd784b04dbf0a69bc99b794c119ea8", "ja": "うん……ありがとねぇ。\nでも、さっきの子達、本当にすごくて。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你啊。\n不过，刚才那些孩子真的很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1056_035hin", "source_sha256": "275d621d70446fc93662c581b00d4be255600b4b3da777a069404c80cd258a35", "ja": "あたしも頑張ったんだけども、\nなんだか上手くできなくて……。申し訳ないべさ。", "zh": "我也努力过了，可总觉得做得不太好……真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1057_008tak", "source_sha256": "141241c01033009853540a2443b3ad7d8cbf2d112cfe63dbe4a1ff2d3b8e7a5c", "ja": "……。ひなた。\nもしや彼女達に遠慮しているのですか？", "zh": "……。日向。\n难道你是在对她们有所顾虑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1058_035hin", "source_sha256": "f4eedace0c8671c1555275db6ace4598a24348394a6871a51d82668b2cfe21f1", "ja": "ううん、そんなこと……。\nないと、思うけども……。", "zh": "没有，没那回事……\n应该，没有才对呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1059_p", "source_sha256": "9361e9eef95e42d4dfae17e94fcafb2fc157a99c2bc385f3fce50fe71c7083a7", "ja": "……ギリギリの戦いだと、意識していなくても、\n気持ちの差が結果に出たりするからな……。", "zh": "……在势均力敌的较量中，就算没有刻意去想，\n心态上的细微差距也可能会体现在结果上啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1060_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be807fd3cf3295deedc99f17229b60a27c7599db070ce9e03ff2eba544a353bb", "ja": "あー、それはあるよね。ダンスもさ、ほんのちょっと\n気分が変わっただけで、全然別モノになったりするし。", "zh": "啊——确实会这样呢。跳舞也是，哪怕心情只发生了一点点变化，跳出来的感觉也可能完全不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1061_027say", "source_sha256": "b29c16a9dc98156f208593fd7304f703a80b7fb3561223739ddc503c43f8bd33", "ja": "ひなたちゃん。もしかして、\nさっきの人達のこと、応援してるんじゃ……？", "zh": "日向。难道你是在给刚才那些人加油……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1062_035hin", "source_sha256": "45ea3d05cb9072bcb292df908b399924c7e4681bf88b7ca4383cd83b4166d3dc", "ja": "……うん。がんばって欲しいとは思ってるよぉ。\nあの子たちは、あたしと同じだから……。", "zh": "……嗯。我确实希望她们能加油呢～。\n因为那些孩子，和我很像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1063_035hin", "source_sha256": "33ce4239a96075f4610057b9a0fceac923fc3cd125c3b08d15370a62d037738a", "ja": "でも、そう思うのも、\nいけないことなんだろうか……？", "zh": "可是，就连这么想，也是错误的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1064_021mat", "source_sha256": "e59d526784255366fe3d9f7a5611570f3257612328d51eca91e62a5a7ef98b7b", "ja": "……。\nでは、ひなたちゃんは、負けてもいいのです？", "zh": "……。\n那么，日向就算输掉也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1065_035hin", "source_sha256": "a54e8533daf022f4fcd58bebeb1247b117cc40b7ae0c32d132a15def8e58037f", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そんなこと……。\nそれとこれとは、話が違うっしょや？", "zh": "诶！？才、才不是那样……  \n这跟那是两码事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1066_035hin", "source_sha256": "3c973ba22efcf8e9a83307a2f1e9bd05f9215f65b4a78bd0b5ca2934ac51cf6f", "ja": "あたしにも、ばぁちゃん達がいるし。\nあ、あたしだって、負けるわけにはいかないべさ！", "zh": "我也有奶奶她们。\n我、我也不能输啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1067_008tak", "source_sha256": "e647def4ad7850e13cb4f2c82c37074a8a2d53817e8a5cd16505775f89414030", "ja": "はたして、それだけでしょうか。", "zh": "当真只有这些吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1068_035hin", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1069_008tak", "source_sha256": "23d9b6df81be087376559dcbdacbb3bdeb84323124d2896ce7f74d1b9f53c7b3", "ja": "仲間のために、家族のために、誰かのために……。\nそうした思いは、ひなたのいう通り、皆同じなのです。", "zh": "为了伙伴，为了家人，为了某个人……  \n正如日向所说，这样的心情，大家都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1070_008tak", "source_sha256": "169873a99b034c990f04039bf5f69502a2e614e03cb2c85da874ec3e72cb4cca", "ja": "ひなたも、彼女達も……、\nおそらくここにいる皆も、私も。", "zh": "日向也好，她们也好……  \n恐怕在这里的所有人，包括我也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1071_035hin", "source_sha256": "723d1afa90f22374abb3aeafc75c30dc31f5bd6df74fee6422a2bbad76fe70b0", "ja": "た、貴音お嬢さんも……みんなも？", "zh": "贵音小姐也……还有大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1072_p", "source_sha256": "ca91e1dcc53fd7abc8dc80c9daa8f4155d5a523e527781495969f2bb7803de4c", "ja": "……周りの気持ちに寄り添ってしまうのは\nひなたのいい所だと思う。", "zh": "……能设身处地为他人着想，我觉得这正是小日向的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1073_p", "source_sha256": "f34c6d4f54d2828da2d58f1ea9bcf14305629a71da37eaf1412993cffa4515dc", "ja": "でも同じくらい、悪い所だと思う。", "zh": "但我也觉得，这同样是你的缺点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1075_p", "source_sha256": "64288cb4475d63c15c74ab6c5c0192c0afaf27d78fd6685060105224c1e2a744", "ja": "だから思い出してほしいんだ。自分がどんな\nアイドルに憧れたのか……。どうして憧れたのか。", "zh": "所以，我想让你回想起来。你曾憧憬过怎样的偶像……又为什么会憧憬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1076_035hin", "source_sha256": "7ba027af21a8f91677a35e6494721ee1198117c8f682534409dd0830dbbd4eec", "ja": "どんな……、どうしてって。\nあたしは、立派なアイドルになりたくて……。", "zh": "什么……为什么……  \n我想成为一名出色的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1077_035hin", "source_sha256": "95aca432cb68faba470b7323694417ae49146872caa084c9c1597de9e5bf249f", "ja": "歌も踊りも上手で、お姫様みたいに綺麗で……。\nアイドルは、誰よりもキラキラしてて……。", "zh": "歌也唱得好，舞也跳得好，像公主一样美丽……  \n偶像应该比任何人都更加闪耀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1078_035hin", "source_sha256": "54541865ce9e6508dfb166f06526a1a0afb1f177464a1f0ef9a25fc3dedfe977", "ja": "……。\n誰、よりも……。", "zh": "……。\n比任何人都……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1079_p", "source_sha256": "0372c980236aedd5ba7ce1dbb12a0e64b6b4f4a08fb517d3faafa357c33557ce", "ja": "うん。アイドルがキラキラしてて、みんなに憧れられる\nのは、きっとこう思ってるからだと思う。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得，偶像之所以闪闪发光、受到大家憧憬，一定是因为心里这么想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1080_p", "source_sha256": "e819db2cea1cb1a6f3607bc92503c10634d1ad2dba60771c334dc8254a2406b0", "ja": "誰よりも輝きたい、って。", "zh": "想比任何人都更加闪耀——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1082_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c220c795ee62d55083da533f61cd1a8d986a2f90832bc63819343e405ef02ef", "ja": "そうだよねぇ。あたしがアイドルになる前、\nリンゴ姫になれたのだって……。", "zh": "对吧。我在成为偶像之前，之所以能成为苹果公主，也是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1083_035hin", "source_sha256": "e229a6331e5bed73dfe29ac211f150dcd7c039c56b50b0eb2c77d3078eb1f8d7", "ja": "あたしが誰よりも、ずっと憧れてたから……！", "zh": "因为我一直比任何人都更加憧憬着……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_141_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_141_1084_p", "source_sha256": "23dfdb141d6a9b21c55ca7a4a1b40c814f363bd9de0701563b749ec808a339fa", "ja": "……うん、そうだよな。\n今も、その頃と同じ気持ちでいいと思う。", "zh": "……嗯，说得也是。\n我觉得你现在也保持和那时候一样的心情就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
